{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d3abee65790ee0c98f690955e98e533cc6190cd613fa84e120c34f7a6cd8ef87", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。あずささんに誘われて、\nプールへ泳ぎの練習をしに行った……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。受梓邀请，去了游泳池练习游泳……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "67f52584f9f98a62ebb696604673002c39ad0a38455f1acb5e70d1cdb6ec2b79", "ja": "今日はありがとうございました。\nお休みなのに、一日中付き合ってくださって。", "zh": "今天谢谢您了。明明是休息日，却还陪了我一整天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4fc1ce60c8d04d689f343443a31aa385eced7b7b5e1ffc43303395128250e8f4", "ja": "気にしないでください。\nあずささんに教えるの、楽しかったですよ。", "zh": "请别放在心上。教秋月小姐也是件很开心的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "f740527c7681394e90867acea5559a112dc600c7cfe1bc0194a6551874a44151", "ja": "うふふ。アイドルは、海やプールのお仕事も多いです\nからね。いつまでもカナヅチさんというのも……。", "zh": "呵呵。因为偶像在海边和泳池的工作也挺多的\n呢。总是一只旱鸭子的话也有点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "466a4781efa791500dc03671c325b556337b022d34ed8610f907f8fb901cfdfa", "ja": "とはいえ、泳ぐには、まだまだ道のりは険しいですね。\nはあ～……。", "zh": "不过，要学会游泳，前面的路还很漫长呢。唉～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a5b514baf294d9f7416b1af92654931e4f42ac13db2246e0f4c9e6edb82b6ad4", "ja": "ま、まあ……そうかもしれませんけど、\n今日の練習で、かなり上達したと思いますよ！", "zh": "不过，不过……或许是这样没错，\n但我觉得经过今天的练习，已经进步很大了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "13bf5ee3bfde8b3ffa4e7f8d3dc80e00b7ee7046e0c1e3340328288c300123dc", "ja": "そうでしょうか……？　一日中頑張っても、\n結局、水に浮くことしかできませんでしたけど。", "zh": "是这样吗……？就算努力了一整天，到最后也只能浮在水面上而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de8bd2a94bd720fea4c191e0b326ad8b5866f353d7df8c82b9dc37c2e703fc75", "ja": "でも、ちょっとは水に慣れたんじゃないですか？\n少しずつ苦手意識をなくすことが大事だと思いますよ。", "zh": "不过，多少也已经习惯水了吧？我觉得，慢慢消除对水的畏惧很重要哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "72f23ebb1a5703544d28b7fe8b3e51f1a366f0c94dd2efffbadab0d41e74240f", "ja": "あっ、言われてみれば確かに、慣れてはきたような。\n一日中、水に触れてましたからね。それに……。", "zh": "啊，听您这么一说确实，好像是习惯了一些呢。\n毕竟一整天都泡在水里嘛。而且……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "65793a28dca4fdd6e0ba35e379f2de7f7a2c07050dfc65b8bc26672757344320", "ja": "{$P$}さんが見守ってくれたので、\n安心できた、というのも、大きいかもしれません。", "zh": "因为有{$P$}先生一直守护着我，\n能感到安心，这一点或许也是很大的原因呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8fbf7e6f0947a3a1d35c053be1e61f2d00ea38055a9e30854ccb9fd68bde5bfb", "ja": "はは、よかったです。\n不安を取り除くお手伝いができたみたいで。", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。\n看来我也帮上忙，让您消除了不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "c34c9ababe679fb171c9db0bbb1201ef4437d83a5e321f7652b41c53dbfb6968", "ja": "うふふ♪　ちなみに……\n今日みたいに誘ったら、また一緒に来てくれますか？", "zh": "呵呵♪　顺便问一下……\n要是像今天这样邀请你，下次还会陪我一起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "6231434487d1c52a654e0ef4100410bdef14139125157b948c910d59618069c7", "ja": "{$P$}さんと一緒なら、\n泳ぐ練習も、もっとできそうな気がするんです。", "zh": "我觉得只要和{$P$}先生一起，就能多练习游泳了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9a79a42b12869e73a751c52027f63a35e10fc90273cdc3b20f61950c83eec907", "ja": "もちろんです。あずささんが泳げるようになるまで、\nいくらでも付き合いますよ！", "zh": "那是当然。在梓小姐学会游泳之前，\n我随时都可以奉陪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "18c3af08ff4c9af934866ed0cbf9f2ec41760722b92e0ccd3cb62261e97cedd6", "ja": "まあ、泳げるようになるまで、いくらでもですか？\nそんな風に言われてしまったら、私……。", "zh": "哎呀，要一直陪我到能学会游泳为止吗？\n被您这么一说，我都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0413_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "8093ea5a12224dd7a966982bf272efc54b69db197808b274fb0c4b48c0b40f45", "ja": "すぐに上達しなくてもいいかも……なんて。\nそれでは、またお願いしますね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "就算没能马上进步……也没关系吧……我是这么想的。\n那就下次再拜托你了。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
